---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contribute - Skillsets.cc">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 md:py-12 overflow-x-hidden">
    <header class="mb-8 border-b border-accent/20 pb-6 relative">
      <div class="specular-edge-bottom"></div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-medium font-serif text-text-ink">We'd all love to learn from you!</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="surface-panel specular-border border border-accent/20 p-4 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <div class="surface-speckle"></div>
      <div class="surface-gloss"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary mb-6 font-serif leading-relaxed">
          You built a skillset that works — skills, agents, hooks, plugins, MCP, all wired together
          and battle-tested on real projects. You're committed to maintain and improve it going forward.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary mb-6 font-serif leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-text-ink">Skillsets.cc</strong> is the high-signal path between you and the community.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-serif leading-relaxed">
          Add the marketplace, run <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">/contribute</code>, and Claude walks you through the entire process.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif mb-6 text-text-ink">What the process looks like</h2>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold font-mono">
            1
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif text-text-ink mb-2">Claim a Slot</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-serif">
              Sign in with GitHub and claim an open slot from the <a href="/" class="text-accent hover:underline">registry</a>.
              Once claimed, you have <strong class="text-text-ink">one week</strong> to submit.
              Your handle stays private until the PR is approved.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold font-mono">
            2
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif text-text-ink mb-2">Scaffold</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary mb-3 font-serif">
              Claude auto-detects your existing
              <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">CLAUDE.md</code>,
              <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">.claude/</code>,
              <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">.mcp.json</code>,
              and any support stacks, then scaffolds the submission structure.
            </p>
            <div class="surface-panel specular-border border border-accent/20">
              <div class="surface-speckle"></div>
              <div class="surface-gloss"></div>
              <pre class="relative z-10 p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>your-skillset/
├── skillset.yaml          # Manifest (required)
├── PROOF.md               # Production evidence (required)
├── AUDIT_REPORT.md        # Generated by the audit steps
└── content/               # What /install actually delivers
    ├── CLAUDE.md          # Project instructions
    ├── README_&lt;NAME&gt;.md   # Skillset docs (won't clobber user's README)
    ├── LICENSE            # License (required)
    ├── .claude/           # Claude Code settings
    ├── .mcp.json          # MCP servers (if any)
    └── [support stacks]   # Docker, configs, etc. (if any)</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold font-mono">
            3
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif mb-2 text-text-ink">Develop & Document</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-serif">
              Develop your skillset in
              <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">content/</code>.
              Edit <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">PROOF.md</code>
              with evidence of production use — project links, metrics, videos, or writeups.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold font-mono">
            4
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif mb-2 text-text-ink">Structural Audit</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-serif">
              Manifest schema, required files, content structure, file sizes, and secrets detection.
              Claude runs this automatically and reports any issues to fix.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold font-mono">
            5
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif mb-2 text-text-ink">Qualitative Review</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-serif">
              Evaluates every primitive against published criteria, discovers MCP servers,
              verifies collaboration artifacts in the reference repo, and runs a safety scan.
              Grant Claude permission to access the reference repo when prompted.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold font-mono">
            6
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif mb-2 text-text-ink">Submit</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-serif">
              Claude forks the registry, creates a branch, and opens the PR.
              Requires <a href="https://cli.github.com/" class="text-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub CLI</a> installed and authenticated.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-sm bg-accent text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold font-mono">
            7
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif mb-2 text-text-ink">Review & Merge</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-serif">
              Maintainers review your production proof and validate the audit report.
              Once approved, your skillset is published to the registry.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="surface-panel specular-border border border-accent/20 p-4 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <div class="surface-speckle"></div>
      <div class="surface-gloss"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif mb-4 text-text-ink border-b border-accent/20 pb-2 inline-block">Hard Constraints</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary mb-4 font-serif">
          CI re-validates every PR before merge. These checks are gating.
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="min-w-full text-left border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-accent/20">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold font-serif text-text-ink">Check</th>
              <th class="py-2 font-bold font-serif text-text-ink">Rule</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-text-secondary font-serif">
            <tr class="border-b border-accent/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold text-text-ink">Manifest</td>
              <td class="py-2">Valid schema, semver version, author handle, tags, production links</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-accent/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold text-text-ink">Required files</td>
              <td class="py-2"><code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">skillset.yaml</code>, <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">content/</code>, <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">content/README_&lt;NAME&gt;.md</code>, <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">content/LICENSE</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-accent/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold text-text-ink">Content structure</td>
              <td class="py-2">Both <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">content/.claude/</code> and <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">content/CLAUDE.md</code> present</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-accent/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold text-text-ink">Secrets</td>
              <td class="py-2">No hardcoded credentials (AWS <code class="font-mono text-sm">AKIA</code>, GitHub <code class="font-mono text-sm">ghp_</code>, OpenAI <code class="font-mono text-sm">sk-</code>, Anthropic <code class="font-mono text-sm">sk-ant-</code>)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-accent/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold text-text-ink">README links</td>
              <td class="py-2">Links to <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">content/.claude/</code> must use full GitHub URLs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-accent/10">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold text-text-ink">Version</td>
              <td class="py-2">Updates must have version &gt; existing registry version</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-bold text-text-ink">MCP consistency</td>
              <td class="py-2">Content&#x2194;manifest MCP declarations must match</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif mb-4 text-text-ink">Updating an Existing Skillset</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary mb-4 font-serif leading-relaxed">
        Already published? Run <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">/contribute</code> again.
        Bump the version in <code class="bg-black border border-accent/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono text-sm">skillset.yaml</code>, and Claude handles the rest.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/skillsets-cc/main/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
        class="text-accent font-mono font-bold hover:underline"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Read Full Contributing Guide →
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
